    "from_name": "Jordan Sample",
    "re_line": "Re: Billing Dispute - Account FB-2026-000001, Statement Date 2026-09-04, Amount in Dispute $84.00",
    "body": "Dear Norman Regional Health System Billing Office,\n\nI am writing to dispute a duplicate charge on my account FB-2026-000001, dated 2026-09-04. I am a self-pay patient and I have reviewed my statement carefully against your posted price file.\n\nThe problem is on lines 3 and 4. Both lines bill procedure code 85025 (Complete Blood Count CBC) on 2026-08-14, each at a list charge before discount of $140.00 and a your price of $84.00. That is two charges for the same test on the same date. Your own price file, at row 13220, lists 85025 Complete Blood Count Cbc with a posted gross of $140.00 and a discounted cash price of $84.00 - one entry, one price. Only one CBC was performed on 2026-08-14, so only one charge of $84.00 should appear on my bill.\n\nThe duplicate your price charge of $84.00 on line 4 should be removed. Your price file published under 45 CFR 180.50 supports this: row 13220 shows a single discounted cash price of $84.00 for this service, not two.\n\nI am asking for a corrected statement that removes line 4 and reduces my balance by $84.00. Please respond to me in writing by 2026-10-04. I understand that is also my payment due date, and I am prepared to pay the correct amount promptly once I receive a corrected statement. Submitting this written dispute before that date is my good-faith effort to resolve this without the account going to collections.\n\nThank you for your time and attention to this matter.\n\nSincerely,\nJordan Sample\n\nSources:\n- The hospital's own standard-charges file, row 13220: 85025 Complete Blood Count Cbc, posted gross $140.00, discounted cash price $84.00 (file fetched 2026-09-13). https://www.normanregional.com/documents/PFS/736048282_norman-regional-health-system_standardcharges.csv\n- 45 CFR 180.50 requires this hospital to publish its standard charges, including the discounted cash price, in a machine-readable file. https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-45/part-180",
    "citations": [
      "row 13220",
      "45 CFR 180.50"
    ],
    "footer": "Fairbill drafts letters from public price data. This is not legal advice. Patient names in this demo are fictional."
